menu "MeshPay application"

config MESHPAY_DAG_MONITOR_ONLY
    bool "DAG monitor only"
    default n
    help
        Build a read-only DAG monitor application. The app listens to LoRa
        frames, updates monitor counters, and does not initialize the wallet
        runtime or Reticulum node transmitter path.

config MESHPAY_FORCE_ESPNOW_ONLY
    bool "Force all Reticulum traffic over ESP-NOW (temporary)"
    depends on MESHPAY_RADIO_ESPNOW_LORA_CORE1262 || MESHPAY_RADIO_ESPNOW
    default n
    help
        Temporary override: route every Reticulum packet (announce and DAG
        sync) over ESP-NOW only. The LoRa bearer stays initialized but never
        carries traffic. Reversible by disabling this option (the default
        announce:ESP-NOW / DAG:LoRa policy then resumes). Intended for the
        Waveshare ESP32-S3 hybrid profile.

endmenu
